MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_001: Hmm. I knew that the imperial capital of Dagsion\nwould be a chaotic metropolis.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_002: Yet beneath that chaos is a meticulous design that\nthwarts any invasion.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_003: Hello, Bonaventure. Taking good care of your soul,\nI hope.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_004: Hm? Ah, the young maiden we met once. You do say\nthe strangest things.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_005: It's not strange to care about people's souls. Out of\ncuriosity, though, what are you up to?
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_006: Committing the imperial capital to memory. Thus far\nI have studied the castle walls, towers, and plazas.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_007: My goodness. It's incredible that you can remember\nall that.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_008: But why would you want to?
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_009: It is rare that I visit this city. I thought it wise to\ncarry it home inside the storehouse of my mind.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_010: A city's structure has a certain tactical importance.\nAnd of course, Saramis has a special interest in...
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_011: Forgive me. This is not a fitting topic to be discussed\nwith a young maiden.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_012: It's alright. I know just what you mean.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_013: Hmm? Have I misjudged you?
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_014: Every walk through the capital offers new sights to\nsee. It never gets old!
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_015: There's nowhere like Dagsion. Of course you'd want\nto soak it all up for later!
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_016: Er, no, Orchel. I was not merely sightseeing.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_017: You know, I say it's new every time, but every now\nand then it looks very familiar. I don't know why.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_018: {SetColor=Gray}She paid me no heed at all.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_019: I have an idea. We should stroll around the\ncapital together.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_020: You can tell me all about what you've learned from\nyour careful study!
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_C_021: The Living Archive of Saramis is not your tour guide.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_001: *sigh*
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_002: Is something troubling you, Orchel?
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_003: Yes, it's this cat mask of mine.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_004: I've always loved how cute it is. But it does mean\nmy opponents keep underestimating me.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_005: I should think that an asset, rather than a liability.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_006: My, my. What a sight to behold.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_007: Bonaventure! It's rude to stare at people.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_008: My sincerest apologies. I was overtaken by\nyour beauty.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_009: Aww... That keeps happening to me. I've had\nno peace ever since I lost my mask.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_010: Men I've never met approach me every day as if\nthey know me.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_011: Alas, that does tend to happen when one's unmasked\nface is so lovely.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_012: Maybe I should try a different mask.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_013: What kind of design would you suggest,\nBonaventure?
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_014: I am neither a craftsman nor an artist.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_015: True, but you know almost everything. You must\nhave some wisdom to share.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_016: There is a certain spirit in the traditions of my\nkingdom said to ward off evil.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_017: Its mouth is ringed with fangs beneath its five-eyed\nglare. Just the thing to repel unwanted attention.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_018: Er...that might be too intense for everyday wear.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_019: Well, as I said, you may have better results\nconsulting a craftsman.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_020: Just west of here lies a mask shop. I suggest looking\nthere for a visage that suits your needs.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_021: I didn't know Dagsion had such things. You see?\nI knew your knowledge would come in handy!
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_022: I'll make that my first stop. See you later!
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_023: That hopefully settles that. Hm?
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_024: Hmm, maybe I should ask Credna for a new mask\nfirst before I go shopping for one.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_025: Mm... Oh! That's a cute store. So many\ncolorful fabrics...
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_026: Ohoho! They'd make a nice gift for Credna.
MID_SE_Orh_Bon_B_027: How fickle her mind is! Perhaps the cat mask is the\nmost appropriate after all.